From a3ab37912eec7f74434cea21b1da05f06dd44960 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: modpunk <27315771+modpunk@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Mon, 28 Sep 2026 21:23:59 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 4/6] dt-bindings: input: apple,z2-multitouch: Add iPhone 6s

The iPhone 6s multitouch controller (iOS AppleMultitouchN1SPI, marked
Z2Compliant in its IOKit personality) speaks the same Z2/HBPP protocol
as the Touch Bar controllers.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Signed-off-by: modpunk <27315771+modpunk@users.noreply.github.com>
---
 .../bindings/input/touchscreen/apple,z2-multitouch.yaml          | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/input/touchscreen/apple,z2-multitouch.yaml b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/input/touchscreen/apple,z2-multitouch.yaml
index 44158e89e818..3b4cf2d5de40 100644
--- a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/input/touchscreen/apple,z2-multitouch.yaml
+++ b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/input/touchscreen/apple,z2-multitouch.yaml
@@ -20,6 +20,7 @@ properties:
     enum:
       - apple,j293-touchbar
       - apple,j493-touchbar
+      - apple,n71-multitouch
 
   interrupts:
     maxItems: 1
-- 
2.55.0

